            "review_text": "Lastlove\nBangkok, Thailand1001 contributions\n0\nDelish Mushroom hot pot in my life\nJun 2023 • Couples\nThe foods were fresh and delicious especially for mushrooms named «nam gan bo sua do » means red milk cow liver mushroom, it looks the same as cow liver. The taste and texture were unforgettable. \n\nThe services were unexpectedly great. The waitresses and waiters know their job well, we just sat, waited and enjoyed our meal as each dishes needs different cooking time. \n\nThis place us a must try one.\nRead more\nWritten July 11, 2023",
