            "review_text": "hayleylawton123\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nGood restaurant with a lot of kind mushroom\nMay 2017 • Friends\nMy college and me went to this restaurant for dinner. we had many choice of mushroom from Japan, especially we like coprinut comatus mushroom and fresh salmon on the hot pot, the soup which taste really natural sweet. But we dislike about the service in here, we spend a long time to wait the waitress bring the beverage and food but nobody told us anything.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 5, 2017",
