            "review_title": "Review at Ashima Mushroom Hotpot",
            "review_text": "Paul W\nTaipei, Taiwan17 contributions\n0\nTerrible service + scam\nMay 2017 • Couples\nHi all,\nI live in Asia for a long time and I've been to many hot pot restaurants. I've a very open and positive mind about cultures and people. However, I need to write my bad experience with Ashima mushroom hotpot. \nFirst of all, the service was bad, even rude: the waiter was very unpatient to my wife (she is Asian). She asked some questions to the waiter, but instead of answering, he sad: \"You have to order mushrooms!\" and constantly forcing what we should order. It wasn't just to recommend us, he said it very forced and rude. No feeling to interact at all.\nAfter a while, our hotpot arrived. Another waitress helped us to start it up, what is nice. But she constantly interrupted our meal. She even took the spoon out of my hands to cook. I know in hotpot restaurants it is pretty common, but if customers don't like that, she shouldn't keep coming back every minute to show us what to do.\nI asked her politely that we are fine without help. She got it, but what happened is that another waitress took over, not even asking us if we need any assistance, no, she threw all the vegetables and meet in the soup. I was almost in shock!\nFinally, we got the bill: couple of things we didn't order was listed: beans, napkins, cashew nuts etc. Because they provided it on our table, we had to pay for. They never told us, so we thought it comes as a usual thing with the main food. Total cost for these little extra's: over 100.000VND. A real scam in my eyes.\nThis is my first bad review on TripAdvisor, but I feel I need to share this.\nGood luck with making your choice to give it a try overthere!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 7, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
